  "_doc": "iris tones by iris row, top to bottom, for a 3 px iris (2 px irises drop the middle column; 4 px repeat it). The lit column (key light side) of the top row becomes the highlight h (A5) unless the highlight parameter moves it. n = I3 depth tone. 'ignited' replaces the whole iris.",
